596
00:57:34,446 --> 00:57:37,427
[SPEAKER_04]: So, it's like having to touch it, basically.

597
00:57:37,787 --> 00:57:40,248
[SPEAKER_04]: And then, that's truly limitless energy.

598
00:57:40,488 --> 00:57:44,249
[SPEAKER_04]: And you realize... because you see it for yourself, the benefit.

599
00:57:44,409 --> 00:57:46,489
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, so, it's a... it's a... it's a feedback loop.

600
00:57:46,790 --> 00:57:48,010
[SPEAKER_04]: Feedback loop.

601
00:57:48,050 --> 00:57:51,391
[SPEAKER_04]: It's like... you teach your own mind.

602
00:57:51,451 --> 00:57:51,951
[SPEAKER_04]: Okay, look.

603
00:57:52,131 --> 00:57:54,471
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, you're not inclining towards this now.

604
00:57:55,752 --> 00:57:56,352
[SPEAKER_04]: Do you realize?

605
00:57:57,401 --> 00:58:01,242
[SPEAKER_04]: How much better this is compared to everything that it was before.

606
00:58:01,962 --> 00:58:13,086
[SPEAKER_04]: And once it fully understands that, then even the energy is like... not even limitless, it's like... why do I need energy for?

607
00:58:13,206 --> 00:58:17,607
[SPEAKER_04]: That's what the Buddha said, like, you complete the work, nothing further needs to be done.

